[00:14.72]For those who teach the Word of God,
[00:21.62]There is a joyful share.
[00:28.70]The benefits that we receive
[00:36.18]Are far beyond compare.
[00:43.50]We imitate the Son of God
[00:50.72]And how he taught with love.
[00:58.10]And as we teach, the ones we’re helping
[01:04.86]Draw close to God above.
[01:23.86]As teachers of Jehovah’s Word,
[01:30.70]We strive to do what’s right,
[01:37.98]So all may see sincerity
[01:43.89]As we reflect God’s light.
[01:52.64]With diligence we search God’s Word,
[01:59.52]For it has news to tell.
[02:07.04]So we can share our heart’s good treasure
[02:14.04]And teach ourselves as well.
[02:32.60]Jehovah gives us all we need
[02:39.28]To teach his precious Word.
[02:47.04]So if we pray to ask for help,
[02:54.36]We know that we’ll be heard.
[03:01.58]We love what’s in the Word of God;
[03:08.82]What’s more, we know it’s true.
[03:16.28]And as we love the ones we’re teaching,
[03:23.50]They’ll soon be teachers too!
